&lt;p&gt;As Nigeria’s largest merchant acquirer, we power most of the country’s point-of-sale (POS) transactions. Through our subsidiaries, Moniepoint Inc. processes over $250 billion in digital payment transaction value annually.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;At Moniepoint, we are a customer-focused community dedicated to crafting solutions that redefine our industry. We leverage artificial intelligence and data-driven best practices to support our businesses, from providing credit and overdrafts to ensuring every transaction is secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Curious about what makes Moniepoint an incredible place to work? Check out our stories on how we cultivate a culture of innovation, teamwork, and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Purpose&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;The Regional Security Lead ensures that our mission never stops. You are the guardian of our physical spaces, ensuring that every Moniepoint office is a sanctuary where our team can build and create without worry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;By leading regional security operations, managing on-ground teams, and proactively identifying risks, you provide the stability and safety that allows financial happiness to thrive. You don&#39;t just react to incidents; you build the systems that prevent them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safeguard our People and Assets: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead the implementation of security policies that protect our team, offices, and equipment across your region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master the Environment:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Conduct regular security assessments to spot vulnerabilities and design innovative strategies to reduce risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the Front Line:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Supervise and mentor private security guards and armed police personnel, ensuring they perform their duties with mastery and respect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Strong Alliances:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Act as our primary liaison with law enforcement and emergency services, ensuring we always have a seat at the table during emergencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investigate and Solve:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Lead the response to security breaches and accidents, providing clear, factual reports that help us learn and improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Design and deliver training programs that equip our security personnel and employees with life-saving protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate for Safety:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Stay ahead of security trends and technology (like CCTV and access control) to keep our regional operations modern and resilient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Business Resilience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Provide expert guidance on asset recovery and fraud investigation when the business needs your mastery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Background:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Should have at least 5 years of experience successfully leading a security team in a guard services/physical security company or have 5 years of experience as an ex-commissioned service personnel supervisor—either in the military, police, or paramilitary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;A Bachelor’s degree in Criminology, Psychology, Criminal Justice, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certification:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;You hold a recognized security certification such as CPP, PSP, or CPO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;A clean criminal record and the ability to pass a comprehensive background check are essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;You speak the local dialects of the major tribes in your assigned region, allowing you to connect with the community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Good experience working with automated security systems like CCTV cameras, burglary alarm systems, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are a Hero:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;You are driven by mastery and the desire to protect others. People count on you to come through when things get tough.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are Relatable:&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t hide behind technical jargon. You communicate clearly and build trust with everyone, from the security guards to the executive team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are Proactive:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;You don’t wait for things to go wrong. You have the &quot;Creator&quot; spirit, always looking for better ways to secure our future.&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are composed:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;In high-pressure situations, you are the calmest person in the room. You lead with facts, not emotions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zero Preventable Incidents:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Our regional offices remain safe, secure, and fully operational.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Readiness:&lt;/strong&gt; Security personnel are well-trained and respond to drills or real-world events with 100% precision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Community Ties:&lt;/strong&gt; You have built a network of local stakeholders that helps Moniepoint navigate regional risks effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Security technology is 100% functional, and documentation is factual, honest, and actionable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;We put our people first and prioritize the well-being of every team member. We’ve built a company where all voices are heard, and we look out for one another. Above all, we are human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;We have a learning- and development-focused environment with an emphasis on knowledge sharing and training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;You’ll receive an attractive salary, pension, health insurance, and an annual bonus, plus other benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect in the hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;A preliminary phone call with the recruiter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;An interview with the hiring team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;An interview with a member of our executive team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Moniepoint Inc. is an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and candidates.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moniepoint Inc. is Africa’s all-in-one financial platform, helping 20 million businesses and individuals access seamless payments, banking, credit, cross-border, and business management tools each month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Nigeria’s largest merchant acquirer, we power most of the country’s point-of-sale (POS) transactions. Through our subsidiaries, Moniepoint Inc. processes over $250 billion in digital payment transaction value annually.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The Senior Business Analyst plays a key role in shaping the growth and success of Moniepoint’s payment products. You&#39;ll design, test, and implement strategies that improve user acquisition, boost retention, and elevate product engagement.&amp;nbsp;This role blends deep quantitative analysis with collaborative, strategic thinking. You&#39;ll partner with teams across the business to ensure our payment solutions meet real market demands and grow efficiently as we scale. Ultimately, you&#39;ll make sure our products not only attract users but also scale sustainably to create financial happiness for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Curious about what makes Moniepoint an incredible place to work?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://moniepoint.com/blog&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Check out posts on how we cultivate a culture of innovation, teamwork, and growth.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with product managers, business development, and data engineering teams to help our growth team uncover problems and make product metrics highly visible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex product and business questions into simple, actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain, and scale self-service dashboards and custom visualisation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end analytics for our growth products—from gathering data requirements and estimating opportunity sizes to designing experiments and conducting post-launch impact reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate trusted relationships across teams, acting as a collaborative link between technology, business, and product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply advanced mathematical and statistical modelling techniques (including A/B tests, multivariate testing, clustering, and supervised learning) to solve practical business problems that drive high-impact results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 to 4 years of professional experience (excluding academic projects and internships) in a quantitative analysis role within high-scale tech companies, tier-1 consulting firms, or investment banks with strong programming demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent SQL skills (which we will test during our interview process).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience designing, running, and analysing experiments on digital products (such as A/B and multivariate tests).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with popular visualisation tools like Tableau or Looker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying statistical modelling and advanced analytics to deliver practical, product-shaping insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong skills in statistical programming (Python) and familiarity with tools like Pandas, SciPy, and Jupyter notebooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, professional spoken and written English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture - We put our people first and prioritise every team member&#39;s well-being. We’ve built a company where all opinions carry weight and where all voices are heard. We value and respect each other and always look out for one another. Above all, we are human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning - We have a learning and development-focused environment with an emphasis on knowledge sharing, training, and regular internal technical talks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation - You’ll receive an attractive salary, pension, health insurance, annual bonus, plus other benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect in the hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A preliminary phone call with one of our recruiters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A panel interview with a member of the hiring team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A behavioural and technical interview with a member of the Executive team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Moniepoint is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and candidates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

